          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪಥ್ಯ — pathya — \"a diet; a special diet\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಧುಮೇಹ ಇರುವುದರಿಂದ ಅಪ್ಪ ಪಥ್ಯ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾರೆ. madhumēha iruvudarinda appa pathya māḍuttāre. Because he has diabetes, father keeps to a diet."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪಥ್ಯ (pathya) ಮಾಡು, to keep to a diet."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪಥ್ಯ (pathya) is borrowed from Sanskrit pathya, \"suitable\" (CDIAL 7746): food that suits the patient."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
