              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಜೀವಸತ್ವ — jīvasatva — \"a vitamin\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಣ್ಣುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ತುಂಬಾ ಜೀವಸತ್ವಗಳು ಇವೆ. haṇṇugaḷalli tumbā jīvasatvagaḷu ive. Fruits have lots of vitamins."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಜೀವಸತ್ವಗಳು, jīvasatvagaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಜೀವ, life + ಸತ್ವ, essence. Everyday talk also says ವಿಟಮಿನ್."
            }
          ]
        },
